      "statement": "RTLBaseCpu bridges a Verilator-simulated RTL core over two full AXI4 master ports (instruction and data), each with its own Axi4MasterEngine, and its tick loop is modeled on BaseKvmCPU rather than AtomicSimpleCPU because actual instruction execution happens inside the RTL, not gem5.",
