    {
      "id": "claim_3eaa52fd48bc4f85980ba4b4935b3744",
      "statement": "RTLBaseCpu's instAxiPins()/dataAxiPins() may alias the same underlying pin object for a core with one unified AXI4 master port; in that case RTLBaseCpu::tick() only ticks instPort_'s engine and skips dataPort_.tick() entirely, because Axi4MasterEngine::tick() unconditionally samples/drives the AR/AW/W/R/B channels regardless of its driveClock argument, which only gates the clk_i toggle.",
